messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 318 and 372?. I think the correct answer is: 218296\n', "<think>\nTo find the product of 318 and 372, I'll start by breaking down each number into its place values. \n\nFirst, I'll express 318 as 300 + 18 and 372 as 300 + 72. \n\nNext, I'll use the distributive property to multiply each part of the first number by each part of the second number. This means I'll calculate:\n- 300 multiplied by 300\n- 300 multiplied by 72\n- 18 multiplied by 300\n- 18 multiplied by 72\n\nAfter calculating each of these individual products, I'll add them all together to get the final result.\n. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
